# HP2_PAD_SCRIPT for phase3_first_level.sh (XInput HLE syntax: src/hle/xinput/pad_script.h).
# Frames = presented frames (D3D Swap count), movies skipped.
# The controller is connected from boot, as for a player: the XInput HLE
# reports it as an insertion on the first XGetDeviceChanges (the game marks a
# port live only on an insertion; without it the level stops at "PLEASE
# RECONNECT THE CONTROLLER TO PORT 1", which phase3_first_level.sh checks).
# Main menu: New Game -> save slots: Continue Without Saving -> confirm Yes.
450 press A
520 press DOWN 4
540 press DOWN 4
560 press DOWN 4
600 press A
700 press A
# The Burrow intro cutscene runs to ~5900. Gameplay: walk forward, turn left, walk.
6000 stick L 0 1 90
6150 stick L -1 0 30
6200 stick L 0 1 100
